{"total":28,"start":1,"num":25,"nextStart":26,"results":[{"id":"cc4e7b8e4d1f4779976208568a77481f","owner":"GDA_GIS","created":1718658165000,"modified":1718660324000,"guid":null,"name":"Conservation_Easements_20240617","title":"Conservation Easements_20240617","type":"Feature Service","typeKeywords":["ArcGIS Server","Data","Feature Access","Feature Service","Metadata","Service","Singlelayer","Hosted Service"],"description":"<div style='text-align:Left; font-size:12pt;'><p><span>Montana lands with conservation easements. This layer shows private lands parcels on which a public agency or qualified Land Trust has placed a Conservation Easement in cooperation with the land owner. According to State Law (Montana Code Annotated 76-6-207) easements must be recorded in the county where the land lies. The county clerk and recorder shall provide a copy of the conservation easement to the Department of Revenue office in that county within 30 days. The Montana Department of Revenue updates this dataset typically once a month. Map features in this data set are not intended as a legal depiction of public or private surface land ownership boundaries and should not be used in place of a survey conducted by a licensed land surveyor. The data are derived from the Montana Cadastral parcel layer.<\/span><\/p><\/div>","tags":["Gallatin County","Montana","MT","recreation","trails","parks","public land","private land"],"snippet":"Conservation easements layer used in the prohibitive layer of the suitability map phase of the FLUM. Updated June 17, 2024","thumbnail":"thumbnail/thumbnail.png","documentation":null,"extent":[[-111.71719826449984,44.653865184965014],[-110.78724000880801,46.18812948973251]],"categories":[],"spatialReference":"26912","accessInformation":"Gallatin County","classification":null,"licenseInfo":"","culture":"en-us","properties":null,"advancedSettings":null,"url":"https://services5.arcgis.com/k6rZTDGNZ7Srk5IB/arcgis/rest/services/Conservation_Easements_20240617/FeatureServer","proxyFilter":null,"access":"public","size":-1,"subInfo":0,"appCategories":[],"industries":[],"languages":[],"largeThumbnail":null,"banner":null,"screenshots":[],"listed":false,"numComments":0,"numRatings":0,"avgRating":0,"numViews":19163,"scoreCompleteness":83,"groupDesignations":null,"apiToken1ExpirationDate":-1,"apiToken2ExpirationDate":-1,"lastViewed":1792191600000,"source":"Ardurra/T-O Engineers"},{"id":"78b00964b46d4e71950e9c0fa670eab9","owner":"GDA_GIS","created":1704822819000,"modified":1718657900000,"guid":null,"name":"Public_Lands","title":"Public Lands","type":"Feature Service","typeKeywords":["ArcGIS Server","Data","Feature Access","Feature Service","Metadata","Multilayer","Service","Hosted Service"],"description":"","tags":["Gallatin County","Montana","MT","recreation","trails","conservation easements","parks","public land"],"snippet":"Gallatin County, MT, Public Lands","thumbnail":"thumbnail/thumbnail.png","documentation":null,"extent":[[-111.81128084379101,44.472504515754686],[-110.69795472783491,46.19474080817182]],"categories":[],"spatialReference":"26912","accessInformation":"","classification":null,"licenseInfo":"","culture":"en-us","properties":null,"advancedSettings":null,"url":"https://services5.arcgis.com/k6rZTDGNZ7Srk5IB/arcgis/rest/services/Public_Lands/FeatureServer","proxyFilter":null,"access":"public","size":-1,"subInfo":0,"appCategories":[],"industries":[],"languages":[],"largeThumbnail":null,"banner":null,"screenshots":[],"listed":false,"numComments":0,"numRatings":0,"avgRating":0,"numViews":36888,"scoreCompleteness":58,"groupDesignations":null,"apiToken1ExpirationDate":-1,"apiToken2ExpirationDate":-1,"lastViewed":1792191600000,"source":"Ardurra/T-O Engineers"},{"id":"e79c58f09d42469ea53edc817509668d","owner":"GDA_GIS","created":1704758306000,"modified":1707489361000,"guid":null,"name":"Agriculture_and_Property_Type","title":"Agriculture and Property Type","type":"Feature Service","typeKeywords":["ArcGIS Server","Data","Feature Access","Feature Service","Metadata","Multilayer","Service","Hosted Service"],"description":"","tags":["Gallatin County","Montana","MT"],"snippet":"Gallatin County, MT, Agriculture and Property Type","thumbnail":"thumbnail/thumbnail.png","documentation":null,"extent":[[-111.82230567644122,44.4627959145398],[-110.73679055310848,46.197942450429146]],"categories":[],"spatialReference":"26912","accessInformation":"","classification":null,"licenseInfo":"","culture":"en-us","properties":null,"advancedSettings":null,"url":"https://services5.arcgis.com/k6rZTDGNZ7Srk5IB/arcgis/rest/services/Agriculture_and_Property_Type/FeatureServer","proxyFilter":null,"access":"public","size":-1,"subInfo":0,"appCategories":[],"industries":[],"languages":[],"largeThumbnail":null,"banner":null,"screenshots":[],"listed":false,"numComments":0,"numRatings":0,"avgRating":0,"numViews":9035,"scoreCompleteness":61,"groupDesignations":null,"apiToken1ExpirationDate":-1,"apiToken2ExpirationDate":-1,"lastViewed":1792209600000,"source":"Ardurra/T-O Engineers"},{"id":"714993caa182462b8ee1fc7155172fea","owner":"mark_egge","created":1789578090000,"modified":1789578103000,"guid":null,"name":null,"title":"Bozeman New Residential Units Since 2010 (MT DOR assessor, 1 dot  1 unit) - dots","type":"Feature Service","typeKeywords":["ArcGIS Server","Data","Feature Access","Feature Service","Service","Singlelayer","Hosted Service"],"description":"\n<p><b>What this shows.<\/b> Every dwelling unit inside current City of Bozeman limits with an\nassessor-recorded year of construction from 2010 onward. <b>One dot is one unit.<\/b> Dots are placed\nat random inside the unit's parcel polygon, so a dot is not an address and units in a single complex\nshare one parcel.<\/p>\n<p><b>Source.<\/b> Montana Department of Revenue ORION CAMA database (Gallatin County, tax year\n2026), republished by the Montana State Library and joined to the Montana Cadastral parcel layer.\nResidential dwellings come from the Res table, one row per unit; apartment and mixed-use buildings\nfrom the Com table as UnitsPerBldg x IdenticalUnits. Condominium common elements and mobile home\npark spaces are excluded to avoid double counting.<\/p>\n<p><b>Year basis.<\/b> The colour is the assessor's <b>year built<\/b>, roughly completion year. It is\nnot the permit application year and not the occupancy date. Comparing this layer with a\npermit-based layer will show a systematic offset for that reason.<\/p>\n<p><b>The lag caveat.<\/b> New construction reaches the assessment roll with a delay, so the most\nrecent years are undercounted: 2025 is partial and 2026 is absent entirely. For the last year or\ntwo, city permit data is more current. Demolitions are also invisible, because the 2026 snapshot\ncontains only buildings still standing.<\/p>\n<p><b>Validation.<\/b> ORION reports 6,315 in-city units built 2010-2019 against a decennial census\nnet gain of 6,071 housing units over the same decade. ORION is gross construction and the census\nfigure is net of demolition, so the ~4% excess is the expected relationship.<\/p>\n<p>City limits are current-day, so land annexed after a unit was built is included.<\/p>\n","tags":["Bozeman","Montana","housing","residential units","new construction","assessor","ORION","CAMA","dot density","Gallatin County"],"snippet":"Every residential unit built in Bozeman since 2010, one dot per unit, coloured by assessor year built. Source: Montana DOR ORION CAMA assessor data.","thumbnail":null,"documentation":null,"extent":[[-111.119321,45.63560300000001],[-111.0011,45.730284999999995]],"categories":[],"spatialReference":"102100","accessInformation":null,"classification":null,"licenseInfo":null,"culture":"english","properties":null,"advancedSettings":null,"url":"https://services9.arcgis.com/KIYpHD2E5ZkT2ON3/arcgis/rest/services/Bozeman_New_Residential_Units_Since_2010_MT_DOR_assessor_1_dot_1_unit_dots/FeatureServer","proxyFilter":null,"access":"public","size":-1,"subInfo":0,"appCategories":[],"industries":[],"languages":[],"largeThumbnail":null,"banner":null,"screenshots":[],"listed":false,"numComments":0,"numRatings":0,"avgRating":0,"numViews":22,"scoreCompleteness":66,"groupDesignations":null,"apiToken1ExpirationDate":-1,"apiToken2ExpirationDate":-1,"lastViewed":1792206000000},{"id":"5dba1bea234c449292ccf858df0e89a4","owner":"Jzlomiecvfd","created":1727394382000,"modified":1727394492000,"guid":null,"name":"Gallatin_County_MT","title":"Gallatin_County_MT","type":"Feature Service","typeKeywords":["ArcGIS Server","Data","Feature Access","Feature Service","Metadata","Service","Singlelayer","Hosted Service"],"description":"<div style='text-align:Left;'><div><div><p>Extracted from <a href='https://cvfdmontana.maps.arcgis.com/home/item.html?id=6567477b52b1421292c77831e5581a60#' style='overflow:hidden; text-overflow:ellipsis; flex:0 0 auto; margin:0px; border-bottom:1px solid transparent;' rel='nofollow ugc'>Montana Administrative Boundaries Framework<\/a>.<\/p><p><span>Database of Montana Counties created to be coincident with the Montana Cadastral Parcel Boundaries. Where county boundaries are coincident with public land survey section lines, they were copied from the BLM's Geographic Coordinate Database (GCDB). If boundaries were not coincident with GCDB lines, they were digitized on screen from 1:24,000 scale Geological Survey Digital Raster Graphics (DRGs). County Boundaries will change as the GCDB is adjusted by the BLM and those data are imported into the Cadastral Data Model.<\/span><\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div>","tags":["counties","montana county boundaries","Montana Spatial Data Infrastructure","Montana county boundary","county boundary","governmental units","county","MSDI","Administrative Boundaries Framework","boundaries","Montana","county lines","Montana Administrative Boundaries","MSDI_ABF","Montana counties"],"snippet":"County boundary for Gallatin County Montana. Pulled from the Montana Administrative Boundaries Framework feature class set. County b